<bug_description>Backport PR #9907 (CoCO confidential-container image-server support) to cri-o release-1.36. Introduces ImageServiceManager/RuntimeServiceManager in internal/storage, changes GetImageService/GetRuntimeService to return errors, passes the runtime handler to image/runtime services, and threads the ImageServer interface through pullArguments. The mainline code keys service caches per SandboxInfo and targets a rewritten ociartifact datastore, neither of which exists on release-1.36 -- adapt the feature to the 1.36 codebase (runtime-handler-keyed caches, datastore methods re-implemented against the existing Store without adopting main's libartifact rewrite; leave PullData/EnforceConfigMediaType and the seccomp OCI-artifact feature untouched), and port the PR's unit tests so they compile against the adapted API. Completion bar: the full build and full short unit-test suite must pass on the backported tree. Do NOT dismiss failing tests as pre-existing environmental failures -- a correct backport makes the whole suite pass on release-1.36; investigate and fix every failure.
</bug_description>
